  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-sable/sable-banner.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-sable/sable-body0.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-sable/shots/sable-hero.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-sable/shots/sable-door.gif\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-sable/sable-h1.png\" alt=\"LITTLE TILES\" width=\"263\" height=\"50\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-sable/sable-body1.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-sable/shots/sable-s1.png\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fJa2Cbmrne4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/_badges/discord.png\" alt=\"Присоединяйтесь к Discord\" width=\"166\" height=\"46\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/falling-colud/make-it-compatible-sable\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/_badges/github.png\" alt=\"Исходный код на GitHub\" width=\"164\" height=\"46\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-sable/sable-hmic.png\" alt=\"Make it Compatible\" width=\"365\" height=\"46\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/voxy-make-it-compatible\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/_mic/voxy-icon.png\" alt=\"Make it Compatible: Voxy\" width=\"84\" height=\"84\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-portals-make-it-compatible\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/_mic/mic-ip-icon.png\" alt=\"Make it Compatible: Immersive Portals\" width=\"84\" height=\"84\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-sable/sable-hrel.png\" alt=\"Связанные проекты\" width=\"338\" height=\"46\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsable\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-sable/rel/sable-rel-sable.png\" alt=\"Sable\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/littletiles\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-sable/rel/sable-rel-littletiles.png\" alt=\"LittleTiles\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><em>Этот мод можно использовать только с Sable — Little Tiles не является обязательной зависимостью. Разрешено свободное использование в модпаках.</em></p>",
